BASICS

Guide mice into rocket and avoid cats for high score.

{2}Glossary: {1}
Chus	- Mice. 
Kapus	- Cats.
Hatch	- These generate Chus and Kapus.
Rocket	- Goals.
Holes	- Kill creatures.
Spinner	- Random event generator

{2}Movement: {1}
Creatures will move in a straight line until they hit a wall, at which point they always turn right.

{2}Tips: {1}
Place your arrows to create movement paths for chus and kapus.
Guide Chus into your rocket.
Guide Kapus into opponents rocket
